    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-26: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.75";
    dc:description "The standard P versus NP core is maximally operational and discriminating, but it remains an open proof problem and is not feasible for a small team on existing evidence. Current computation can explore instances but cannot resolve the claim.";
