    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Resolve whether every NP language has a deterministic polynomial-time algorithm by proving P=NP or P≠NP in a standard computational model. Either valid proof gives an unambiguous decision.";
